00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:44,140
 And so the idea is you're going to do one thing if it's in there, and you're going to retrieve the current thing.

85
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:46,140
 Otherwise, you're going to pick a default value.

86
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:49,140
 In this case, we'll pick one. I mean, pick zero.

